        "back_text": "Back",
        "custom_title": "22100 - Poly-Comfort Treatment Table",
        "intro_highlight": "Engineered in North America to meet the rigorous demands of high-volume aesthetic clinics, the Poly-Comfort treatment chair combines absolute frame stability with targeted manual positioning. By offering a rock-solid, fixed-height foundation paired with manual articulation, this professional station provides continuous daily reliability without electronic complexity.",
        "custom_description": "<p>Poly-Comfort is purpose-built for licensed professionals, including Esthetician practitioners, Lash Technicians, and Skincare Specialists. Its heavy-duty framework targets lower-back tension and shoulder strain during back-to-back appointments, enabling sharper focus on treatment execution and service consistency. Whether you are performing deep-pore cleansing, brow sculpting, or post-procedure recovery, this professional station adjusts to your workflow needs with manual backrest-and-legrest levers and an intuitive 15° seat tilt system.</p><p></p>",
        "subtitle": "Ergonomic Manual Positioning with Integrated 15° Tilt Dynamics",
        "secondary_description": "<p></p><p>Durable construction is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the ultra-clean finish and surface integrity of Poly-Comfort, perform routine wiping down with non-abrasive sanitizers formulated for professional spa environments between each client. The ultra-resistant leatherette surface resists oil build-up and staining, ensuring pristine visual presentation across years of intensive clinic operations. Consistent care preserves material flexibility, prevents surface cracking, and upholds hygienic presentation.</p>",
        "show_variant_selectors": true,
        "show_color_option": true,
        "show_size_option": true,
        "featured_product": "poly-comfort",
        "btn_label": "ADD TO CART",
        "show_compare_btn": true,
        "compare_btn_label": "Compare with other models"
      }
