          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Licensed Esthetician & Facial Specialist:",
            "answer": "<p>The Poly-Comfort table provides unhindered facial and neck access through its precision-engineered contour and adjustable headrest. Practitioners can easily perform intricate treatments, waxing, and electrolysis without physical strain, while the steady fixed height allows seamless positioning relative to ambient lighting and equipment carts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Spa & Salon Professional:",
            "answer": "<p>Optimized for general body care and multi-purpose spa treatments, the independent manual section adjustments and stable heavy-duty base allow clinicians to position clients precisely. The durable, chemical-resistant vinyl withstands frequent sanitization protocols required in professional spa settings.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Spa Director & Clinic Manager:",
            "answer": "<p>Investing in Equipro equipment guarantees long-term reliability and minimal downtime. The robust mechanical adjustment systems and steel chassis are backed by a 2-year manufacturer warranty, ensuring continuous, heavy-duty operation across high-turnover treatment rooms.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
